  "name": "automatafl-react",
  "description": "Automatafl-react is a specialized web frontend for a tactical board game that integrates cellular automata mechanics with competitive multiplayer elements. Built on a reactive architecture using React and Zustand, the system facilitates real-time state synchronization through a dual-channel communication layer employing both WebSockets and EventSource. The application manages complex game lifecycles, encompassing matchmaking queues, move conflict resolution, and Elo-based ranking, while providing administrative interfaces for health monitoring and snapshot restoration.",
